[8.802, "o", "\u001b[?2026h/egm-brainstorm I want to build an out-of-tree Apache NuttX application and custom board configuration in a new\r\n  `xiao-rp2350-bargraph/` directory of this workspace for a Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350 mounted on a breadboard with 1\u001b[K\r\n  potentiometer and 6 discrete LEDs acting as a bar graph, with a USB-C NSH console and automatic startup at boot,\u001b[K\r\n  keeping `nuttx/` and `apps/` unmodified.\r\n\n  Constraints for this session:\r\n  - Ask me one concern at a time.\r\n  - Instruct any research subagents to read nearest EGM README.md contracts before reading .c/.h files.\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90C\u001b[33mauto\u001b[39;2m · Gemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[103C\u001b[?2026l"]
