[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33AWould you prefer \u001b[94mbargraph start\u001b[m to double as the command that returns from \u001b[94mset\u001b[m back to potentiometer sensing, or\r\n  would you rather have an explicit \u001b[94mbargraph auto\u001b[m (or \u001b[94mresume\u001b[m) subcommand?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> both start resuming and an explicit bargraph resume command. User friendlyness for the win.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 32s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial focus is on the user's explicit session constraint regarding EGM README contracts. Sp...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 22 files \u001b[37m(CMakeLists.txt, Make.defs, Make.defs, +19)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[61D\u001b[33;1mSpawned\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have launched the \u001b[1m\u001b]8;id=jk435fd2663ddd6102;conversation://4e2441cd-da92-46e9-9ea7-d2f7e60bb7f9\u0007EGM Brainstorm Synthesizer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jk435fd2663ddd6102;con"]
