[0.117, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 32s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial focus is on the user's explicit session constraint regarding EGM README contracts. Sp...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 22 files \u001b[37m(CMakeLists.txt, Make.defs, Make.defs, +19)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[61D\u001b[33;1mSpawned\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have launched the \u001b[1m\u001b]8;id=jk435fd2663ddd6102;conversation://4e2441cd-da92-46e9-9ea7-d2f7e60bb7f9\u0007EGM Brainstorm Synthesizer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jk435fd2663ddd6102;conversation://4e2441cd-da92-46e9-9ea7-d2f7e60bb7f9\u0007conversation://4e2441cd-da92-46e9-9ea7-d2f7e60bb7f9\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to coordinate\r\n  the parallel Goldfish reviews across all 7 brainstorming lenses (\u001b[94megm-design\u001b[m, \u001b[94megm-codebase-details\u001b[m, \u001b[94megm-zoom-out\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94megm-comprehension\u001b[m, \u001b[94megm-implementation-readiness\u001b[m, \u001b[94megm-structural\u001b[m, and \u001b[94megm-inventive-catalyst\u001b[m). I will synthesize\u001b[K\r\n  their findings into \u001b[94mconcepts_brief.md\u001b[m as soon as the review completes.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThoug"]
