[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33AI have launched the \u001b[1m\u001b]8;id=jk435fd2663ddd6102;conversation://4e2441cd-da92-46e9-9ea7-d2f7e60bb7f9\u0007EGM Brainstorm Synthesizer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jk435fd2663ddd6102;conversation://4e2441cd-da92-46e9-9ea7-d2f7e60bb7f9\u0007conversation://4e2441cd-da92-46e9-9ea7-d2f7e60bb7f9\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to coordinate\r\n  the parallel Goldfish reviews across all 7 brainstorming lenses (\u001b[94megm-design\u001b[m, \u001b[94megm-codebase-details\u001b[m, \u001b[94megm-zoom-out\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94megm-comprehension\u001b[m, \u001b[94megm-implementation-readiness\u001b[m, \u001b[94megm-structural\u001b[m, and \u001b[94megm-inventive-catalyst\u001b[m). I will synthesize\u001b[K\r\n  their findings into \u001b[94mconcepts_brief.md\u001b[m as soon as the review completes.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 0s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial hypothesis: Synthesized brief should be written to the specified file location. Examin...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(concepts_brief.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 9s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have written the synthesized multi-lens brainstorm bri"]
[0.000, "o", "ef to \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdd136329d9a0aeb0;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/concepts_brief.md\u0007concepts_brief.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Key Objections & Hardware/Driver Risks Raised by the Goldfish Review\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mUpstream \u001b[94;22mrp23xx_pwm.c\u001b[39;1m 16-bit Duty Truncation & Shared Slice 3 (\u001b[94;22mD4\u001b[39;1m/\u001b[94;22mD5\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd4f46c317777c6c5;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.h#L52\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.h:52\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 stores duty cycle as \u001b[94muint16_t\u001b[m rather than \u001b[94mub16_t\u001b[m (\u001b[94muint32_t\u001b[m), so\r\n\u001b[6Cpassing standard NuttX \u001b[94mb16ONE\u001b[m (\u001b[94m0x10000\u001b[m = 100%) truncates to \u001b[94m0x0000\u001b[m and turns the LED off at full scale.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[94mrp23xx_pwm.c\u001b[m also ignores \u001b[94mchannels[i].channel\u001b[m and hardcodes \u001b[94mchannels[0]\u001b[m to PWM channel A and \u001b[94mchannels[1]\u001b[m to\r\n\u001b[6CPWM channel B, with \u001b[94mD4\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGPIO6\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPWM3A\u001b[m) and \u001b[94mD5\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGPIO7\u001b[m, \u001b[94mP"]
[0.000, "o", "WM3B\u001b[m) sharing \u001b[94m/dev/pwm3\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[78D• \u001b[3mProposed mitigation in brief\u001b[m: Scale duties to \u001b[94m0..65535\u001b[m (\u001b[94m0xFFFF\u001b[m = 100%) and update both channels of \u001b[94m/dev/pwm3\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Ctogether.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mUpstream \u001b[94;22mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[39;1m 500 kS/s Interrupt Storm, \u001b[94;22m<< 19\u001b[39;1m Sample Shift & RP2350-E9 Pad Leakage\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkad13ae5897b67606;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L261-L266\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c:261-266\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 runs free-running conversions at 500 kHz, shifts 12-bit\r\n\u001b[6Csamples left by 19 bits (\u001b[94mvalue <<= 19\u001b[m), and leaves the digital input buffer (\u001b[94mIE=1\u001b[m) enabled on \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m (\u001b[94mD0/A0\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[3mProposed mitigation in brief\u001b[m: In \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/src/rp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m, pace \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV\u001b[m to \u001b[94m~732\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mHz\u001b[m (cutting interrupt load by 99.85%), disable \u001b[94mIE\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPUE\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPDE\u001b[m on \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m, flush the FIFO "]
