[0.000, "o", "[m (\u001b[94m0x10000\u001b[m = 100%) truncates to \u001b[94m0x0000\u001b[m and turns the LED off at full scale.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[94mrp23xx_pwm.c\u001b[m also ignores \u001b[94mchannels[i].channel\u001b[m and hardcodes \u001b[94mchannels[0]\u001b[m to PWM channel A and \u001b[94mchannels[1]\u001b[m to\r\n\u001b[6CPWM channel B, with \u001b[94mD4\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGPIO6\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPWM3A\u001b[m) and \u001b[94mD5\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGPIO7\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPWM3B\u001b[m) sharing \u001b[94m/dev/pwm3\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[78D• \u001b[3mProposed mitigation in brief\u001b[m: Scale duties to \u001b[94m0..65535\u001b[m (\u001b[94m0xFFFF\u001b[m = 100%) and update both channels of \u001b[94m/dev/pwm3\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Ctogether.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mUpstream \u001b[94;22mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[39;1m 500 kS/s Interrupt Storm, \u001b[94;22m<< 19\u001b[39;1m Sample Shift & RP2350-E9 Pad Leakage\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk995aacffb357552b;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L261-L266\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c:261-266\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 runs free-running conversions at 500 kHz, shifts 12-bit\r\n\u001b[6Csamples left by 19 bits (\u001b[94mvalue <<= 19\u001b[m), and leaves the digital i"]
[0.000, "o", "nput buffer (\u001b[94mIE=1\u001b[m) enabled on \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m (\u001b[94mD0/A0\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[3mProposed mitigation in brief\u001b[m: In \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/src/rp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m, pace \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV\u001b[m to \u001b[94m~732\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mHz\u001b[m (cutting interrupt load by 99.85%), disable \u001b[94mIE\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPUE\u001b[m/\u001b[94mPDE\u001b[m on \u001b[94mGPIO26\u001b[m, flush the FIFO (\u001b[94mANIOC_RESET_FIFO\u001b[m) before\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Ceach 50 Hz read, and decode \u001b[94m(am_data >> 19) & 0x0fff\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mOut-of-Tree App Discovery Without Modifying \u001b[94;22mapps/\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • The Make build system only scans direct subdirectories of \u001b[94mapps/\u001b[m (\u001b[94mapps/*/Make.defs\u001b[m).\r\n\t\u001b[3mProposed mitigation in brief\u001b[m: Use the gitignored \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m symlink (\u001b[94mapps/external -> ../xiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbargraph/apps\u001b[m, listed in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1618d414bd585ac9;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/apps/.gitignore#L33\u0007apps/.gitignore:33\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) created automatically by \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/scripts/Make.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b"]
